WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.100 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 8=

01:39.180 --> 01:44.500
(The Day of the Peony Festival;
Upright and Honorable)

02:31.700 --> 02:34.700
(Cuiyun Tower)

02:42.780 --> 02:44.940
(Cuiyun Tower)

03:02.620 --> 03:04.500
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

03:06.740 --> 03:09.020
(Mingde Gate)

03:09.020 --> 03:10.420
The year the seven
Military Governors rebelled,

03:11.060 --> 03:12.100
my whole family was killed.

03:12.940 --> 03:14.260
I was forced into a life of degradation.

03:16.740 --> 03:17.740
Ten years have passed.

03:18.740 --> 03:20.700
No one's ever lifted a finger
to help me,

03:21.860 --> 03:23.260
let alone buy my freedom.

03:23.700 --> 03:25.020
We've both fallen on hard times.

03:25.860 --> 03:26.220
Miss,

03:27.540 --> 03:28.020
you must leave now.

03:30.140 --> 03:31.300
But if I leave today,

03:32.260 --> 03:33.260
what will happen to you?

03:33.780 --> 03:35.140
If Zhang Renjing finds out

03:35.380 --> 03:36.900
you bought my freedom,

03:37.180 --> 03:37.420
then...

03:37.420 --> 03:37.900
Don't worry.

03:39.420 --> 03:40.540
I'll find a way out.

03:41.580 --> 03:43.020
Just leave Sheng'an,

03:43.380 --> 03:45.580
so he can never bother you again.

03:46.500 --> 03:47.860
You've saved me twice.

03:49.300 --> 03:50.100
I'm deeply in your debt.

03:51.420 --> 03:53.940
I'll repay you in my next life.

03:54.300 --> 03:55.260
All I wish is

03:55.940 --> 03:56.700
that you can live freely

03:57.420 --> 03:58.340
from now on.

04:11.680 --> 04:14.200
(Mingde Gate)

04:24.420 --> 04:24.940
(Mr. Zhang!)

04:25.060 --> 04:25.780
(It's been a while.)

04:25.780 --> 04:26.340
(Nice to see you both!)

04:26.340 --> 04:31.180
(Sigui Garden)

04:36.780 --> 04:37.180
Captain,

04:37.820 --> 04:38.380
sorry for the wait.

04:40.220 --> 04:41.460
What took you so long?

04:41.620 --> 04:42.740
I've waited ages.

04:43.500 --> 04:44.300
I came on foot,

04:44.620 --> 04:45.140
so I'm a little late.

04:46.020 --> 04:47.700
The private room is ready.

04:51.420 --> 04:51.980
It's ready?

04:53.300 --> 04:54.260
Please follow me.

04:58.780 --> 04:59.260
This way.

05:11.260 --> 05:11.660
Where is she?

05:13.300 --> 05:13.980
Please wait, Captain.

05:14.420 --> 05:15.740
Just a little longer.

05:16.140 --> 05:17.020
I'll let you know

05:17.300 --> 05:18.700
as soon as Xu Mianmian's here.

05:19.620 --> 05:20.580
What a hassle.

05:21.700 --> 05:22.340
Tell her to hurry up!

05:22.500 --> 05:22.780
Got it.

05:23.220 --> 05:23.900
I'll go check.

05:31.940 --> 05:32.420
Captain,

05:33.020 --> 05:33.620
what's this?

05:34.340 --> 05:34.740
Well...

05:36.820 --> 05:39.340
I paid a lot for this
from foreign traders.

05:39.620 --> 05:40.780
It's powerful.

05:44.620 --> 05:45.300
You wouldn't understand.

05:45.660 --> 05:46.140
Go on!

05:46.660 --> 05:46.980
Yes, sir.

05:55.660 --> 05:56.140
Excuse me.

05:56.140 --> 05:57.420
(What a grand procession!)

05:57.420 --> 05:58.540
(Magnificent!)

05:58.540 --> 06:00.380
(I've never seen
such a splendid carriage!)

06:20.580 --> 06:22.980
When will the Peony Goddess rite
be over?

06:23.740 --> 06:24.740
(Jin Bu, Imperial Sacrifice Official)
Your Highness,

06:25.500 --> 06:26.420
it ends at noon.

06:30.140 --> 06:30.580
Good.

06:36.980 --> 06:38.260
(Why not compose a poem?)

06:38.540 --> 06:38.900
(Exactly!)

06:38.900 --> 06:39.820
(It'd add to the fun.)

06:40.500 --> 06:41.700
(Let's just admire the flowers.)

06:51.220 --> 06:52.340
(Such fine blooms)

06:52.780 --> 06:54.260
(are rare to see outside.)

06:55.860 --> 06:57.820
(They must've been carefully tended.)

07:04.660 --> 07:05.100
Your Highness,

07:05.900 --> 07:06.900
go ahead and pray to the Peony Goddess.

07:07.180 --> 07:07.940
I'll excuse myself for a moment.

07:09.220 --> 07:09.740
But we haven't...

07:11.420 --> 07:12.060
Go enjoy yourself, too.

07:17.420 --> 07:18.340
(Let's look over here.)

07:18.420 --> 07:18.740
(All right.)

07:22.020 --> 07:22.540
Yan Shang.

07:30.500 --> 07:30.900
Your Highness.

07:32.340 --> 07:33.380
What brings you here?

07:34.740 --> 07:35.260
What's wrong?

07:36.020 --> 07:37.180
Am I not allowed at this festival?

07:39.100 --> 07:39.780
I just...

07:40.740 --> 07:41.420
never expected

07:41.940 --> 07:43.460
to see you again so soon.

07:45.980 --> 07:46.900
Since I've run into you,

07:47.500 --> 07:49.220
show me around the garden.

07:51.100 --> 07:52.820
Your Highness, I have things to do.

07:53.300 --> 07:54.620
What could be more important than me?

07:56.340 --> 07:56.660
Come.

08:04.340 --> 08:06.340
(Candied fruit, plums, and apricots!)

08:06.620 --> 08:07.180
This one looks nice.

08:08.260 --> 08:08.740
We'll take it.

08:09.980 --> 08:10.340
This one.

08:10.940 --> 08:11.220
And this one.

08:11.220 --> 08:12.540
(Sweet and sour. Delicious!)

08:17.700 --> 08:18.060
This one, too!

08:19.860 --> 08:20.540
Pay up.

08:22.260 --> 08:22.540
Here.

08:27.820 --> 08:28.300
Miss,

08:28.820 --> 08:30.020
get some Peony Goddess knots.

08:30.300 --> 08:31.100
Tie them around your wrists

08:31.100 --> 08:32.660
for good luck and good health.

08:32.860 --> 08:33.540
The Peony Goddess will bless you.

08:34.620 --> 08:35.180
I'll take them all.

08:36.740 --> 08:37.380
Peony Goddess knots!

08:38.940 --> 08:39.220
Help me tie it.

08:39.220 --> 08:40.780
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

08:40.940 --> 08:42.140
(All handmade.)

08:42.860 --> 08:44.260
(Ladies, come take a look.)

08:45.340 --> 08:45.660
Thank you.

08:45.660 --> 08:46.820
(Sachets and purses!)

08:47.740 --> 08:49.580
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

08:53.820 --> 08:54.100
There.

08:54.260 --> 08:54.700
Does it look good?

08:55.900 --> 08:56.540
Of course.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.580
You're not even paying attention.

09:02.900 --> 09:03.500
(Twenty copper coins.)

09:29.620 --> 09:30.780
What are you doing?

09:34.500 --> 09:36.220
Tired of showing me around?

09:36.860 --> 09:37.340
I wouldn't dare.

09:38.900 --> 09:39.540
Keep up.

09:44.700 --> 09:45.180
Yan Shang,

09:46.820 --> 09:47.900
this garden is huge.

09:48.260 --> 09:49.180
What's your favorite spot?

09:50.540 --> 09:52.820
There's an old stone well
in the northwest corner.

09:53.260 --> 09:54.020
The clear water

09:54.540 --> 09:56.020
reflects the clouds and trees.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.580
It's peaceful and lovely.

09:58.740 --> 09:59.380
Not my kind of place.

10:00.740 --> 10:02.700
(Trinkets and knickknacks!)

10:02.940 --> 10:03.620
Let's look over there.

10:05.100 --> 10:07.220
(Lovely things! Come take a look!)

10:07.420 --> 10:08.300
(Miss, have a look!)

10:08.820 --> 10:09.380
Tired from walking?

10:13.780 --> 10:15.340
Shall we take a break?

10:18.420 --> 10:18.860
Yan Shang,

10:20.500 --> 10:22.100
your story last night was bad enough.

10:23.420 --> 10:23.940
Today,

10:24.700 --> 10:25.940
don't upset me again.

10:42.620 --> 10:42.980
Chunhua.

10:47.500 --> 10:47.900
This is for you.

10:57.220 --> 10:57.820
Lip rouge?

10:59.580 --> 11:00.620
Just something I picked up.

11:00.940 --> 11:01.740
I don't know much about these things.

11:02.300 --> 11:03.180
If you don't like it,

11:03.340 --> 11:03.900
throw it away.

11:09.780 --> 11:10.220
And this.

11:12.020 --> 11:12.420
And this.

11:13.900 --> 11:14.380
And this.

11:15.820 --> 11:16.580
These earrings, too.

11:25.620 --> 11:26.460
Hope you like them.

11:27.340 --> 11:27.980
All right.

11:28.380 --> 11:29.060
Stop pulling things out.

11:29.300 --> 11:29.940
I can't carry all this.

11:34.580 --> 11:35.100
Liu Wenji,

11:35.660 --> 11:36.340
I need to ask you something.

11:37.260 --> 11:37.940
Go ahead.

11:38.420 --> 11:39.140
Do you like me?

11:57.900 --> 11:58.380
Liu Wenji,

11:58.900 --> 11:59.700
I do like you.

12:00.260 --> 12:01.460
If you like me too,

12:01.740 --> 12:02.820
will you marry me?

12:12.060 --> 12:12.620
Chunhua...

12:15.940 --> 12:16.500
My father

12:17.180 --> 12:18.460
always told me

12:20.100 --> 12:21.340
that I should earn honors,

12:22.660 --> 12:23.380
pass the imperial exam,

12:24.420 --> 12:24.940
and...

12:28.420 --> 12:28.980
and...

12:32.900 --> 12:34.100
marry...

12:35.900 --> 12:37.820
a woman of noble birth.

12:53.340 --> 12:53.860
But, Chunhua,

12:54.260 --> 12:55.060
that's not what I want.

12:56.620 --> 12:57.380
I like you.

13:05.500 --> 13:06.500
I'll make you my wife.

13:16.820 --> 13:17.620
It's a promise, then.

13:34.780 --> 13:35.220
Thank you.

13:36.020 --> 13:37.620
(Look, isn't this the lot we wanted?)

13:39.180 --> 13:39.540
Go ahead.

13:39.540 --> 13:40.020
(Exactly!)

13:43.660 --> 13:45.180
They say the peony lots here never miss.

13:45.660 --> 13:46.020
Try one.

13:46.860 --> 13:47.580
Your Highness, please.

13:48.420 --> 13:49.260
You draw first.

13:50.340 --> 13:51.700
I don't believe in fortune-telling.

13:52.700 --> 13:53.260
(You two in front!)

13:53.780 --> 13:54.300
(Are you drawing or not?)

13:55.700 --> 13:56.220
Hurry up!

13:59.980 --> 14:02.220
(A phoenix heralds a new age;
the moon lights her lonely path)

14:13.740 --> 14:15.780
(Great statecraft draws vast wisdom;
the heavens await mending at court.)

14:16.180 --> 14:17.140
The court...

14:19.020 --> 14:21.020
Seems you'll hold
the highest office one day.

14:22.820 --> 14:23.580
In that case,

14:24.020 --> 14:24.940
this lot must be wrong.

14:25.500 --> 14:26.180
Governing is hard enough,

14:26.540 --> 14:28.300
(A phoenix heralds a new age.)
let alone "mending the heavens."

14:29.460 --> 14:30.340
What did you draw?

14:31.300 --> 14:31.820
Not telling you.

14:32.660 --> 14:33.340
Didn't you say it doesn't count?

14:52.500 --> 14:55.980
(Retreat of Grace)

15:11.820 --> 15:12.260
(Wonderful!)

15:12.620 --> 15:13.140
(Wonderful!)

15:17.180 --> 15:19.900
(Retreat of Grace)

15:26.460 --> 15:29.300
(Retreat of Grace)

15:40.900 --> 15:42.940
(The Peony Goddess rite is almost over.)

16:12.340 --> 16:13.220
Princess Danyang is over there.

16:19.580 --> 16:19.900
Her stuff.

16:36.100 --> 16:37.060
(So beautiful!)

16:37.900 --> 16:38.660
(Indeed!)

16:41.020 --> 16:42.380
(I've never seen peonies like these!)

16:44.020 --> 16:44.620
Yan Shang, look!

16:44.900 --> 16:45.260
Wanyao!

16:46.980 --> 16:47.900
You scared me half to death!

16:48.380 --> 16:48.980
Where's Yan Shang?

16:50.700 --> 16:51.060
Wanyao,

16:51.820 --> 16:52.500
when did you get here?

16:52.740 --> 16:53.300
Where do you want to go next?

16:53.460 --> 16:53.820
I'll come with you.

16:53.900 --> 16:54.660
I've told you,

16:54.980 --> 16:55.780
don't call me Wanyao.

16:56.980 --> 16:57.460
Coming through!

17:17.020 --> 17:17.540
What is it?

17:18.180 --> 17:20.500
Her Highness wants you
to fetch some wine

17:20.860 --> 17:21.740
and wait for her in the room.

17:21.900 --> 17:23.380
How did you know?

17:26.220 --> 17:27.340
You can ask me anything.

17:27.780 --> 17:28.380
However,

17:28.860 --> 17:30.420
when you're serving Her Highness,

17:30.900 --> 17:32.220
ask fewer questions.

17:35.660 --> 17:36.700
Thank you for the advice.

17:37.020 --> 17:38.020
I'll fetch the wine now.

17:47.700 --> 17:49.180
(Jifu)

17:55.340 --> 17:57.140
(Jifu)

17:59.780 --> 18:00.380
(Jifang)
I've heard

18:00.700 --> 18:02.980
Grand Princess Luling
has a private pavilion in the garden.

18:03.220 --> 18:04.660
Which one is it?

18:05.180 --> 18:06.980
Whenever the Grand Princess
comes to see the flowers,

18:06.980 --> 18:08.700
she takes over Jifang Pavilion.

18:08.900 --> 18:10.140
(Jifang)

18:15.380 --> 18:20.740
(Jifu)

18:37.180 --> 18:38.140
Captain, sorry to keep you waiting.

18:38.660 --> 18:38.980
Let's go.

18:39.820 --> 18:40.580
I'll take you there.

18:40.580 --> 18:41.260
Move it.

18:45.260 --> 18:45.900
This way.

18:47.300 --> 18:48.580
The Jifu Pavilion.

18:49.460 --> 18:50.380
Wait here, Captain.

18:51.060 --> 18:52.180
Miss Xu will be here soon.

18:55.260 --> 18:56.340
(Jifang)

18:58.780 --> 19:00.580
(Jifu)

19:02.580 --> 19:03.020
Fu...

19:03.220 --> 19:05.140
(Jifu)

19:05.940 --> 19:06.740
I know this character.

19:07.460 --> 19:08.820
Fu means good fortune!

19:17.100 --> 19:18.020
(Jifu)

19:21.220 --> 19:23.300
(Jifang)

19:45.580 --> 19:46.500
That idiot!

19:47.260 --> 19:48.300
He's actually fallen asleep!

19:49.460 --> 19:51.420
And he still expects a promotion?

19:52.340 --> 19:53.740
Wake him up!

19:53.740 --> 19:54.180
- Yes!
- Yes!

20:03.620 --> 20:05.060
Who's this old man?

20:14.780 --> 20:15.420
Wake up!

20:41.700 --> 20:43.020
How dare you!

20:43.420 --> 20:44.980
Look at yourself!

20:45.340 --> 20:46.740
How dare you offend me?

20:47.140 --> 20:47.980
Kill him!

20:55.900 --> 20:56.420
Seize him!

20:57.380 --> 20:58.780
Seal off the entire garden!

20:59.300 --> 21:00.380
Until that filthy wretch is caught,

21:00.740 --> 21:01.780
no one is leaving!

21:10.420 --> 21:10.820
(Over there!)

21:11.620 --> 21:12.100
(He's over there!)

21:20.980 --> 21:21.500
(What's happening?)

21:21.500 --> 21:21.820
(Take him away!)

21:23.620 --> 21:23.940
(Move!)

21:28.140 --> 21:28.500
Captain!

21:29.020 --> 21:29.580
Run!

21:33.140 --> 21:33.420
Hurry!

21:34.980 --> 21:35.860
Captain, we're in deep trouble!

21:36.260 --> 21:37.020
I'll get you out of here.

21:37.380 --> 21:37.700
Hurry!

21:51.900 --> 21:52.420
What's going on?

22:13.220 --> 22:13.860
Get me out.

22:31.020 --> 22:31.780
Quiet.

22:32.700 --> 22:34.420
At that ruined temple in Chuzhou,

22:34.860 --> 22:35.780
it was you

22:36.140 --> 22:38.700
who slashed my father's knees!

22:41.900 --> 22:42.540
Your men

22:43.300 --> 22:44.420
killed my little brother.

22:45.860 --> 22:47.580
You slit my mother's throat.

22:48.060 --> 22:48.940
And my eldest brother

22:50.060 --> 22:52.100
was crippled for life.

22:53.260 --> 22:55.380
They suffered a thousand times more

22:56.820 --> 22:57.700
than you!

24:04.300 --> 24:05.060
Zhang Renjing,

24:06.740 --> 24:07.780
did you ever think

24:09.300 --> 24:10.300
this day would come?

25:08.140 --> 25:13.100
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

25:13.100 --> 25:17.380
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

25:17.660 --> 25:22.240
♪Books bear no blade♪

25:22.240 --> 25:26.580
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls
can pierce the sky♪

25:27.820 --> 25:31.980
♪My body is the furnace,
flames reach the clouds♪

25:32.290 --> 25:37.180
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

25:37.580 --> 25:41.420
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

25:41.780 --> 25:46.220
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

25:46.860 --> 25:51.420
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

25:51.940 --> 25:55.860
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

25:56.100 --> 26:00.620
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

26:01.540 --> 26:05.300
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

26:06.180 --> 26:10.780
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

26:11.180 --> 26:14.660
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

26:15.580 --> 26:20.300
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

26:20.980 --> 26:24.540
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

26:38.220 --> 26:38.980
(By order of the Grand Princess,)

26:39.260 --> 26:40.380
(no one may leave the garden.)

26:40.580 --> 26:41.220
(Violators will be arrested!)

26:42.740 --> 26:44.100
There's been a murder in the garden.

26:44.940 --> 26:45.940
As a judicial officer,

26:46.300 --> 26:46.820
I must investigate.

26:48.100 --> 26:48.740
Go on.

26:54.020 --> 26:55.780
(The snake's head and the hornet)

26:56.580 --> 26:57.740
(were crushed beneath the wheel.)

26:58.380 --> 26:59.580
(They were both dead.)

27:00.820 --> 27:01.260
(Your Highness,)

27:03.100 --> 27:03.700
(I'm leaving.)

27:11.300 --> 27:11.900
(Yan Shang,)

27:12.820 --> 27:13.500
(where are you?)

27:17.860 --> 27:18.620
(The clear water)

27:19.140 --> 27:20.620
(reflecting the clouds and trees.)

27:21.340 --> 27:22.220
(It's peaceful and lovely.)

27:41.420 --> 27:41.860
Yan Shang!

27:43.460 --> 27:43.940
Your Highness.

27:44.300 --> 27:44.780
Come with me!

28:03.660 --> 28:03.980
Hurry!

28:04.260 --> 28:04.620
Your Highness...

28:05.380 --> 28:05.700
Go!

28:15.020 --> 28:15.500
Your Highness...

28:17.060 --> 28:17.820
I've killed someone.

28:18.260 --> 28:18.620
Quiet!

28:19.900 --> 28:20.620
I can't get away.

28:21.420 --> 28:22.140
Fang Tong, go!

28:31.300 --> 28:32.260
I won't drag you down with me.

28:32.620 --> 28:33.300
Stop talking nonsense!

28:52.540 --> 28:53.500
(Who's there? Get down!)

29:03.740 --> 29:04.660
What bad luck!

29:05.220 --> 29:06.460
I'll have to burn incense all day!

29:11.700 --> 29:12.300
Aunt!

29:15.100 --> 29:15.740
Wanyao?

29:16.300 --> 29:16.860
You're here too.

29:17.540 --> 29:19.220
I heard someone
was killed in the garden!

29:19.660 --> 29:20.740
How terrifying!

29:22.100 --> 29:22.620
Aunt,

29:23.220 --> 29:24.860
can I go home early?

29:25.540 --> 29:26.820
There's blood everywhere.

29:27.180 --> 29:27.780
I really...

29:28.260 --> 29:30.180
Aunt, I really can't stand
the sight of blood!

29:31.020 --> 29:32.140
Let her go!

29:32.580 --> 29:33.300
Thank you, Aunt!

29:33.500 --> 29:34.220
You're the best!

29:49.780 --> 29:50.740
(Why is that carriage moving?)

29:51.940 --> 29:53.220
(Mr. Shen, easy.)

29:53.860 --> 29:56.420
(Malted milk cakes)

30:06.100 --> 30:06.780
Why did you kill him?

30:13.060 --> 30:13.860
For revenge.

30:14.380 --> 30:14.980
What revenge?

30:17.900 --> 30:19.220
Back when we were in Lingnan,

30:21.740 --> 30:22.860
I told Your Highness

30:23.780 --> 30:25.460
my family fled south

30:27.300 --> 30:28.500
to escape the Rebellion.

30:30.380 --> 30:31.740
Mother dead, younger brother killed.

30:34.740 --> 30:36.020
Father left crippled,
elder brother traumatized.

30:39.220 --> 30:40.380
As we fled south,

30:41.620 --> 30:43.300
we watched prosperous cities fall.

30:44.420 --> 30:45.420
Splendor turned to ashes.

30:47.580 --> 30:49.860
Corpses littered
the fields and wastelands.

30:51.340 --> 30:52.020
Some were soldiers,

30:53.740 --> 30:54.460
others ordinary folk.

30:56.620 --> 30:58.180
Wherever the rebel warlords went,

30:59.100 --> 30:59.940
they slaughtered the people first.

31:01.580 --> 31:02.460
Everyone fled in fear

31:03.660 --> 31:04.860
at their approach.

31:07.820 --> 31:08.940
We were lucky.

31:10.700 --> 31:11.820
We'd managed to escape them all.

31:18.700 --> 31:19.300
And then?

31:22.020 --> 31:22.580
Later,

31:26.820 --> 31:27.860
at that ruined temple,

31:29.300 --> 31:30.860
we ran into a squad of the Shence Army.

31:35.580 --> 31:36.220
We couldn't escape.

31:40.780 --> 31:41.700
They killed innocents
to claim military merit.

31:48.780 --> 31:49.700
The man who just died

31:50.780 --> 31:51.940
was Zhang Renjing.

31:54.940 --> 31:55.500
Back then,

31:58.260 --> 31:59.780
he was just a squad leader,

32:00.940 --> 32:02.180
roaming the area with his men,

32:02.420 --> 32:03.860
desperate to rack up kills.

32:04.580 --> 32:04.980
So...

32:07.460 --> 32:10.020
he cut the ears off innocent people,

32:10.100 --> 32:10.860
stuffed them into a sack,

32:12.380 --> 32:13.220
and claimed military merit.

32:14.100 --> 32:14.420
And then...

32:16.060 --> 32:16.900
he got his wish.

32:20.900 --> 32:21.940
So I killed him.

32:24.660 --> 32:25.820
He deserved to die long ago.

32:36.620 --> 32:37.380
I killed him.

32:39.180 --> 32:40.740
I killed him personally!

32:42.180 --> 32:42.820
I avenged them.

32:43.660 --> 32:44.700
I avenged my family.

32:52.940 --> 32:53.300
Yan Shang.

32:56.780 --> 32:57.340
Look at me.

32:58.740 --> 32:59.580
You've suffered so much.

33:01.300 --> 33:02.340
At last, you've cast off

33:02.940 --> 33:03.820
that heavy burden.

33:04.700 --> 33:06.180
I envy you for that.

33:08.180 --> 33:09.300
You've done right as a son

33:10.460 --> 33:11.100
and as a brother.

33:13.260 --> 33:14.140
If your mother

33:14.900 --> 33:16.140
and brother know from the afterlife,

33:17.700 --> 33:18.500
they can rest in peace.

33:25.980 --> 33:27.580
You've carried this burden for too long.

33:29.780 --> 33:31.140
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

33:34.340 --> 33:34.860
Don't be afraid.

33:38.500 --> 33:39.540
We're out of the garden now.

34:16.020 --> 34:16.660
(How much longer do we have to wait?)

34:16.660 --> 34:17.300
(Everyone, stand back!)

34:17.620 --> 34:17.940
(Exactly!)

34:18.060 --> 34:19.300
(One more step and I'll arrest you!)

34:19.420 --> 34:20.220
(Back off!)

34:20.300 --> 34:20.620
(You!)

34:20.660 --> 34:21.020
(Hurry!)

34:21.460 --> 34:22.100
(Back!)

34:22.180 --> 34:23.100
(We're only following orders!)

34:23.220 --> 34:23.900
(We have work to do!)

34:23.900 --> 34:24.860
(Quiet, or you'll all be arrested!)

34:25.620 --> 34:26.060
Your Highness,

34:26.340 --> 34:27.500
have you seen Princess Danyang?

34:27.820 --> 34:28.820
I've looked everywhere for her.

34:29.260 --> 34:29.620
Quiet!

34:29.620 --> 34:30.260
How dare you!

34:30.980 --> 34:32.820
How would I know where she is?

34:33.980 --> 34:35.220
How dare a maid of Princess Danyang

34:35.500 --> 34:36.660
defy her betters!

34:36.860 --> 34:37.540
(Don't crowd here!)

34:37.620 --> 34:38.380
(Everyone, stand back!)

34:39.220 --> 34:40.260
(Any more trouble, and I'll arrest you!)

34:40.260 --> 34:41.220
(Back! Move back!)

34:41.380 --> 34:41.900
(Back!)

34:41.900 --> 34:42.380
Wenji.

34:42.740 --> 34:43.340
Don't worry.

34:43.540 --> 34:44.260
I'll keep looking with you.

34:44.260 --> 34:44.660
(Back!)

34:44.980 --> 34:45.260
Let's go.

34:45.340 --> 34:45.700
(Back!)

34:47.100 --> 34:48.380
Just my luck!

34:48.580 --> 34:48.900
(Back!)

34:49.300 --> 34:50.180
Go ask them

34:50.300 --> 34:51.300
when they'll let us leave.

34:51.540 --> 34:51.860
(Back!)

34:52.020 --> 34:53.420
I just asked.

34:53.820 --> 34:56.060
Princess Luling is still furious.

34:56.540 --> 34:57.500
She's only a woman,

34:57.980 --> 34:58.900
and all she's got is...

35:02.620 --> 35:03.180
(Let us go!)

35:03.180 --> 35:03.900
(What did we do wrong?)

35:05.780 --> 35:06.900
(I swear, I know nothing!)

35:07.140 --> 35:07.700
(Why are you keeping us here?)

35:07.700 --> 35:08.620
(When will you let us go?)

35:08.620 --> 35:09.060
(Step back!)

35:09.300 --> 35:09.860
(Step back!)

35:10.100 --> 35:10.660
(Let us go!)

35:10.660 --> 35:11.060
(Back!)

35:12.980 --> 35:13.860
(No further!)

35:13.980 --> 35:14.420
(Everyone, stand back!)

35:14.420 --> 35:15.340
(Are you pushing us around?)

35:15.460 --> 35:16.340
(Everyone, back!)

35:19.020 --> 35:20.420
Your Highness,
we couldn't find the killer.

35:20.900 --> 35:21.340
Useless!

35:21.780 --> 35:22.740
Search again!

35:22.740 --> 35:23.060
Yes!

35:26.460 --> 35:26.740
Your Highness,

35:27.300 --> 35:28.460
we've searched
every corner of the garden.

35:28.820 --> 35:30.300
Another search would be pointless.

35:31.140 --> 35:32.660
Though we didn't catch the killer,

35:33.140 --> 35:34.380
we did detain several suspects.

35:35.020 --> 35:35.420
I'll send them

35:35.420 --> 35:36.700
to the Court of Judicial Review
for questioning

35:36.980 --> 35:38.220
and give Your Highness an answer.

35:38.740 --> 35:40.020
Then what are we waiting for?

35:40.620 --> 35:41.340
Back to my residence!

35:49.500 --> 35:50.580
Bring that Imperial Sacrifice official

35:50.580 --> 35:51.380
to the Court of Judicial Review.

35:51.900 --> 35:52.340
I'll question him myself.

35:53.580 --> 35:53.860
Yes, sir!

35:57.340 --> 35:57.700
Stand down!

36:01.660 --> 36:02.020
(They're letting us go!)

36:02.540 --> 36:03.020
(Let's get out of here.)

36:10.420 --> 36:11.020
(Where's Wanyao?)

36:11.980 --> 36:12.420
Chancellor,

36:12.900 --> 36:13.580
where are we going?

36:14.780 --> 36:15.980
South.

36:16.380 --> 36:17.260
Out of the city.

36:17.900 --> 36:18.220
(Got it.)

36:21.100 --> 36:26.140
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

36:29.980 --> 36:30.340
Come.

36:30.700 --> 36:31.260
Let's go home.

36:32.020 --> 36:32.460
Your Highness...

36:34.660 --> 36:35.260
I should be going.

36:36.580 --> 36:37.300
Where will you go?

36:40.220 --> 36:41.060
I've avenged my family,

36:41.540 --> 36:42.420
and thanks to Your Highness,

36:42.940 --> 36:43.660
I've escaped with my life.

36:44.620 --> 36:45.220
In this life,

36:45.780 --> 36:46.420
I have nothing more to ask for.

36:49.620 --> 36:50.500
I must return to Lingnan.

36:51.980 --> 36:52.820
You're leaving so soon?

36:58.780 --> 36:59.740
This cloak...

37:01.140 --> 37:01.700
You can keep it.

37:07.740 --> 37:08.460
It's dirty now.

37:09.300 --> 37:10.740
I can't return it like this.

37:11.980 --> 37:13.180
I'm afraid

37:14.220 --> 37:15.220
I can never repay you

37:16.020 --> 37:16.860
for saving my life.

37:24.340 --> 37:25.540
There's only one thing

37:27.060 --> 37:28.060
I can offer you in return.

37:52.820 --> 37:57.540
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

37:59.860 --> 38:00.340
Your Highness...

38:00.340 --> 38:03.460
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

38:03.460 --> 38:03.900
Take care.

38:07.260 --> 38:13.260
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

38:13.660 --> 38:13.940
Get out.

38:13.940 --> 38:19.100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

38:21.540 --> 38:26.780
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

38:26.780 --> 38:29.540
♪Through trails of mud♪

38:29.540 --> 38:29.980
(Yan Shang,)

38:31.500 --> 38:32.700
(is this really all)

38:34.260 --> 38:35.300
(you want from this life?)

38:35.300 --> 38:39.900
♪- Soar with the wind; burning bright
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

38:40.060 --> 38:43.500
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

38:43.740 --> 38:48.660
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

38:48.940 --> 38:53.620
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

38:53.780 --> 38:55.580
♪Not a single hour less♪

38:55.740 --> 38:59.480
♪However deep the snow♪

38:59.480 --> 39:03.340
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

39:03.420 --> 39:06.820
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

39:06.980 --> 39:10.460
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

39:10.660 --> 39:17.460
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

39:17.740 --> 39:19.220
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

39:19.220 --> 39:22.260
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

39:22.340 --> 39:24.820
♪You're the only one I need♪

39:24.860 --> 39:27.980
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪
(Mingde Gate)

39:27.980 --> 39:32.060
♪Nothing can break us♪

39:32.220 --> 39:34.960
♪Be my one and only in this world;
be my one and only in this life♪

39:34.961 --> 39:35.500
(Mingde Gate)

39:35.580 --> 39:38.980
♪My last untouched innocence♪

39:47.860 --> 39:49.660
Young man, wait.

39:54.300 --> 39:54.860
Chancellor Liu.

39:57.500 --> 39:58.420
Don't forget,

39:59.380 --> 40:02.580
you still owe me a game of Go.

40:04.340 --> 40:05.780
Let's finish it before you go.

40:06.060 --> 40:06.740
What do you say?

40:08.940 --> 40:10.060
You waited here

40:10.780 --> 40:12.180
just to finish that game?

40:12.540 --> 40:13.060
That's right.

40:14.020 --> 40:15.980
Just for that game.

40:30.620 --> 40:32.260
Last time, you said

40:32.380 --> 40:35.500
you came to Sheng'an to right a wrong.

40:35.780 --> 40:37.740
Now that you're leaving,

40:38.180 --> 40:40.580
have you set things right?

40:44.580 --> 40:45.020
I have.

40:49.060 --> 40:52.580
Was killing Zhang Renjing really enough?

41:00.580 --> 41:01.540
To be frank,

41:02.540 --> 41:03.740
I'd seen you at the Imperial Academy

41:04.380 --> 41:05.300
long before we met.

41:05.820 --> 41:06.940
Out of curiosity,

41:07.300 --> 41:08.780
I looked into your background.

41:09.620 --> 41:10.940
I knew your father.

41:11.460 --> 41:12.620
He was good at poems

41:13.340 --> 41:14.700
and famous throughout the capital.

41:15.620 --> 41:17.020
I even met your mother

41:17.660 --> 41:20.180
at her parents' home before she married.

41:21.420 --> 41:23.380
What a remarkable woman,

41:23.860 --> 41:26.180
so free-spirited
and above worldly concerns.

41:29.580 --> 41:31.220
Such fine youths.

41:35.340 --> 41:36.060
But I digress.

41:37.140 --> 41:38.340
At my age,

41:38.540 --> 41:40.220
I tend to ramble.

41:41.260 --> 41:42.780
I waited here today

41:43.340 --> 41:44.980
to ask you just one thing:

41:45.460 --> 41:46.740
is it truly enough?

41:53.180 --> 41:53.980
Zhang Renjing dared

41:54.940 --> 41:56.500
to kill innocents for military merit

41:57.180 --> 42:00.060
because he served in the Shence Army.

42:00.660 --> 42:03.020
The Shence Army dares to kill at will

42:03.500 --> 42:07.140
because Yu Cheng'an controls the court.

42:07.460 --> 42:08.540
Even His Majesty

42:09.300 --> 42:10.980
has to bow to him.

42:11.700 --> 42:14.780
The court keeps showering
the Shence Army with rewards.

42:15.620 --> 42:17.860
Its officers can be promoted

42:18.220 --> 42:19.180
without even reporting.

42:20.060 --> 42:23.700
Even the censors dare not inspect it.

42:25.060 --> 42:27.100
Yu Cheng'an wields such power

42:27.580 --> 42:30.940
because His Majesty needs
his Shence Army

42:31.220 --> 42:32.860
to keep the regional warlords in check.

42:33.620 --> 42:34.500
As for the warlords,

42:34.980 --> 42:38.660
they've amassed troops
and grown restless.

42:38.900 --> 42:39.460
They've even demanded

42:40.260 --> 42:42.540
princesses into humiliating marriages

42:42.780 --> 42:46.300
just to buy the court a moment's peace.

42:48.020 --> 42:49.380
They'll rebel again

42:49.780 --> 42:54.500
at the slightest opportunity.

43:01.740 --> 43:03.220
Lord Yu controls the court,

43:04.540 --> 43:06.260
the warlords run rampant,

43:07.260 --> 43:08.780
and the officials turn a blind eye.

43:10.180 --> 43:11.380
You're right, Chancellor.

43:12.780 --> 43:14.260
Zhang Renjing wasn't the only one

43:15.420 --> 43:16.380
who made my family suffer.

43:17.300 --> 43:20.100
Nor was he the only one who slaughtered

43:21.260 --> 43:22.860
countless innocents.

43:31.260 --> 43:31.780
What a shame,

43:33.060 --> 43:34.380
I'm just a commoner.

43:36.420 --> 43:37.380
There's nothing I can do.

43:41.700 --> 43:46.300
(Next Episode Preview)

43:46.460 --> 43:47.180
Thank you, Your Highness.

43:47.860 --> 43:49.660
I'll probably need to
borrow from you a lot.

43:50.260 --> 43:52.500
Looking you over,

43:53.620 --> 43:54.900
that mouth is your only real asset.

43:55.380 --> 43:55.860
Make sure

43:56.420 --> 43:57.380
you put it to good use.

43:59.180 --> 44:01.320
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world♪

44:03.520 --> 44:06.813
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:09.498 --> 44:14.414
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:16.608 --> 44:22.453
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

44:22.953 --> 44:28.179
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

44:30.948 --> 44:35.739
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

44:36.575 --> 44:42.654
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

44:44.455 --> 44:47.605
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

44:47.605 --> 44:49.253
♪Burning bright as a song♪

44:49.305 --> 44:53.029
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

44:53.407 --> 44:58.073
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

44:58.692 --> 45:02.733
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:03.224 --> 45:05.339
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:05.379 --> 45:12.325
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:13.088 --> 45:16.541
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:16.721 --> 45:19.866
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

45:20.305 --> 45:26.942
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

45:27.339 --> 45:29.377
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

45:29.377 --> 45:31.853
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

45:31.891 --> 45:34.360
♪You're the only one I need♪

45:34.564 --> 45:41.451
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

45:41.763 --> 45:45.034
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

45:45.339 --> 45:48.512
♪My last untouched innocence♪

45:48.836 --> 45:52.262
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

45:52.495 --> 45:55.720
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

45:56.051 --> 46:02.847
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:03.216 --> 46:05.278
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:05.279 --> 46:07.782
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:07.829 --> 46:10.167
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:10.398 --> 46:17.233
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:17.582 --> 46:19.200
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

46:19.330 --> 46:21.126
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

46:21.483 --> 46:24.500
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:24.540 --> 46:25.867
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
